The apple and bird are new procedural, stylized models. They are not scans,
brand logos, imported photographs, measured anatomy, or species identification.

The 2026-10-22 style iteration studies the composition, semantic themes and
native-scroll scene control of TokenNotIncluded/hireferry at revision
4393a467aa91ed0124c6fcbba5e9734ced75e55e. See references/hireferry.md for
source links and the distinction between design reference and runtime support.
The style studio's models and palettes are new authored examples.

